            <div xml:id="d223">

                <pb facs="0980" n="830" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg830"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3532/19–20.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador White to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-10-04"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 4, 1907</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 90.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my dispatch No. 84, of
                    the 27th ultimo, I had the honor of cabling you on the 20th of September that
                    the frontier agreement between France and Liberia had been signed, and that I
                    expected to be shortly in a position to send you a copy of that document, which,
                    thanks to M. Pichon’s courtesy, I transmit herewith, and also a translation of
                    the same.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry White.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d223-a1.xml" xpointer="d223-a1"/>
            </div>
